Implement user story epam-ts-003: Fix Queue.drain returns items in LIFO order instead of FIFO

## Story Description
The Queue class in src/queue.ts implements drain() using array.pop(), which removes from the end (LIFO). Fix it so drain() returns items in the order they were enqueued (FIFO), consistent with standard queue semantics. The source file(s) are in /tmp/epam-bench-epam-ts-003-wjYygO/src/. Do not modify any test files (*.test.ts).

